  <item>
    <title>029 如何避免过度思考</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d38c285a91beebb3dcfa1f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d38c285a91beebb3dcfa1f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Sep 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见，我回来了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期依然是一个自问自答的思考。在过去的一年里，我曾反复被过度思考这件事折磨，但也同时在其中找寻到了一些答案，想在这里分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期节目里你将听到：是什么让我意识到过度思考正在让我变得焦虑和难过？我是如何解决过度思考的？是什么使我们落入过度思考的“陷阱”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的书：</span></p><span></span><h1><span>How to stop overthinking- Liam Anderson</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>Overcome the trap of overthinking- Amit Gupta</span></h1><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3056467883" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3056467883"><span>山山要靠海</span></a><span>，分享女性主义、性暴力、性骚扰观点及生活碎碎念。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/612f4f430000000002020d6e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=612f4f430000000002020d6e&amp;apptime=1725140414&amp;share_id=5227531f45e04030bb7f55d2470d002b" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/612f4f430000000002020d6e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=612f4f430000000002020d6e&amp;apptime=1725140414&amp;share_id=5227531f45e04030bb7f55d2470d002b"><span>山山要靠海</span></a><span>，学习博主，分享读博思考。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnPOpeGwVsoww0VCt9OPsoyW5nCg.m4a" length="22856321" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:15:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhG4NTAQxxjyPQurCgLaEZMcmulD.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>028 延迟满足是一种自我欺骗吗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6520310550cf691d242ab028</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6520310550cf691d242ab028</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Oct 2023 16:08:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>希望大家度过了一个美好的假期！而新学期开始的我，又实实在在忙碌了一周。这周因为一个亲身经历而有了一些有关“延迟满足”思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期节目中你将听到：“延迟满足”这个被“成功学”“幼儿教育”的营销频繁使用的词汇，它是一种自我欺骗吗？我们怎样能够真正获得延迟满足？如何在延迟满足和即时满足之间平衡？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期片尾曲】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Daniela Andrade - River of Gold</span></p>]]></description>
