  <item>
    <title>027 聊八卦也是人类社会进步的源泉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/650d4c075c88d241268e6158</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">650d4c075c88d241268e6158</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Sep 2023 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当我们聊八卦，我们就搭建了与外界联系的桥梁。不论你是谁，做着什么样的工作，以什么样的身份在进行一场交流。一旦我们开始与他人沟通，就很难拒绝“聊八卦”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“八卦”是促进人类社会进步必不可少的沟通形式，可是它如何成为负面信息的代名词，又正在被谁污名化？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】山山（@山山要靠海）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> &nbsp;一些想要跟大家分享的小幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> “八卦”的定义到底是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="359">05:59</a> &nbsp;从进化心理学角度看人们聊八卦的心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="817">13:37</a> &nbsp;从生理学角度看人们在聊八卦师，大脑发生了怎样的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="938">15:38</a> &nbsp;女性真的更喜欢八卦吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目配乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：Jay-Lounge - Puddles</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：Henry Wolfe - Stop The Train</span></p><span></span><p><span>【相关文献】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. Dunbar RI. Gossip in evolutionary perspective. Review of general psychology. 2004 Jun 1;8(2):100-10.</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. Eckhaus, E. and Ben-Hador, B., 2019. Gossip and gender differences: a content analysis approach. </span><em><span>Journal of Gender Studies</span></em><span>, </span><em><span>28</span></em><span>(1), pp.97-108.</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llBKGMQcLGvbpxN0dA6Z_gX67mjc.m4a" length="36284793" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtMEdHbWhDdEdtYjRQbV9lNEh1ajRWbXhXMDQucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>026 无效沟通带给我的焦虑，就这样被解决了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65047fe8bbe351e6160db30f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65047fe8bbe351e6160db30f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 Sep 2023 16:01:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，好久不见，我回来啦（带着些许疲惫和今年不知道第多少次感冒）。这一期，是我忙碌的两周时间里，由社交生活的微小改变而得出的一点思考。也希望能给你一些启发。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容摘要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 在这段时间当中，我的社交方式的变化。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 无效沟通出现的场景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="728">12:08</a> 当无效沟通没有办法避免的时候，我们该如何处理它给我们的情绪带来的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 无效沟通会给我们带来哪些情绪影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> 当你想要改善自己的沟通方式时……</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目配乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jay-Lounge - Puddles</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ruby Haunt - Crave</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrswoWMcBAfZfgkbqm96-hvdVzzW.m4a" length="54294917" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtMEdHbWhDdEdtYjRQbV9lNEh1ajRWbXhXMDQucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
