  <item>
    <title>024 我们为什么那么相信MBTI</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e89f8ae490c5dee5736fb1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e89f8ae490c5dee5736fb1</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Aug 2023 12:33:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容摘要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> 当MBTI成为一句社交问候语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">04:01</a> MBTI人格测试发展的历史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="554">09:14</a> 一个INFJ在互联网大厂面试中的离奇失败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">11:51</a> 荣格的精神分析法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="923">15:23</a> 今天的MBTI已经与荣格的思路背道而驰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a> 人格分析是如何PUA我们的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 我们还能相信MBTI吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1377">22:57</a> MBTI帮助我们找到行为的合理性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> 我们拥有了合理性，却仍然会焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> 量化的MBTI测试，如何加剧社交不平等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1838">30:38</a> 多建设生活，少评价生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目配乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jay-Lounge - Puddles</span></p><span></span><p><span>CMJ - 像我这样的人（纯音乐）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkl7GOohiDdZUn2550-9enTjqKA1.m4a" length="46465149" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtMEdHbWhDdEdtYjRQbV9lNEh1ajRWbXhXMDQucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
